4.1 Development Plan
The project can be developed through the following activities:
Step 1 – Environment Setup
Install Python, FastAPI, Uvicorn, Jinja2 and required dependencies.
Step 2 – AI Model Configuration
Configure Gemini API and the required AI model.
Step 3 – Module Development
Develop:
Explanation module
Q&A module
Quiz module
Summary module
Learning Path module
Step 4 – Backend Development
Create FastAPI endpoints for each functionality.
Step 5 – Frontend Development
Create the HTML interface and CSS styling.
Step 6 – Integration
Connect the frontend with the FastAPI backend.
Step 7 – Testing
Test each functionality individually and together.
Step 8 – Deployment & Documentation
Run the application locally, document the project, and prepare the demonstration.
The project document organizes development into milestones covering model selection, core functionality, frontend development and deployment. EduGenie-Google Gemini Powered Learning Assistant_Document.docx
